  "hints": [
    "Connect logic 1 to the second input of the bit-0 half adder.",
    "At bit 0, Y_0 = A_0 XOR 1 and K_1 = A_0 AND 1.",
    "For i = 1..3, Y_i = A_i XOR K_i and K_(i+1) = A_i AND K_i.",
    "The final carry is C_out = A_3 AND K_3."
  ]
